<title>USA: Audits &amp; Surveys sets special $0.05 cash div.</title>
<headline>Audits &amp; Surveys sets special $0.05 cash div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audits &amp; Surveys Worldwide Inc said on Thursday it declared a special cash dividend of $0.05 per share on its common stock, payable January 15 to shareholders on record December 31.</p>
<p>The company does not currently pay a regular dividend.</p>
<p>The company has about 13 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
